{"id":"evidencia","lemma":"evidencia","pos":"noun","rank":1064,"glosses":["evidence"],"ipa":"/ebiˈdenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"evidencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-evidencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"La evidencia es clara.","en":"The evidence is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460736"},{"text":"Quiero evidencias.","en":"I want evidence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722089"},{"text":"La evidencia es irrefutable.","en":"The evidence is indisputable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506505"},{"text":"Tom quiere evidencias.","en":"Tom wants evidence."},{"text":"La evidencia es irrebatible.","en":"The evidence is indisputable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506506"}]}